⚠️ **The collector is addressed by INDEX, not by address**: `sflow collector id <1-5> ip <A.B.C.D>`.
`sflow collector ip <addr>` is `% Unrecognized command`. The group's restore recipe written into
the campaign queue before this case had guessed the wrong form; it is corrected there now.

⚠️ **The minimum sampling rate is 50** (1 in 50), so a bench cannot ask for 1-in-1.

⚠️ 🔥 **The negations are ASYMMETRIC with the positive forms** -- the same family of trap that
