    no sflow agent ip ?         -> <cr>          i.e. no address either

The rejection also put one line in the device log, `user.err ... Command
[no sflow collector id 1 ip 10.38.22.33] failed`. **That line is my own artefact, not a product
fault**, and it is the only non-echo log line this case produced.

