## STEP 9 -- reboot persistence: NOT MEASURED

🔴 This case performed no reload and wrote nothing to startup-config, so **persistence of the
sFlow configuration across a reboot is NOT MEASURED and is not claimed.** The reason is the
group's: the L3 underlay (vlan10 on port1.0.10, vlan48 on port1.0.48) exists in running-config
only -- boot config is `flash:/default.cfg` -- so a reload destroys the path to the collector,
and writing it to startup-config is a change to the standing bench (STANDING-ORDERS §4), never
taken unattended. Already in the queue as a NEEDS TEST ENGINEER item from group A.

